  "body": "It would be nice to have the option to mark a homeserver, or rather the corresponding domain, as gone from federation and stop other homeservers contacting the domain.\r\n\r\nA possible simple solution would be to do this with a SRV record. Either a new one or adding something to the current available `_matrix._tcp`.",
